    LLM: 'Game: Buck Euchre. 32-card Euchre deck. 4-6 players. Individual (no partnerships). Trump: Bowers (Right=J-trump, Left=J-same-color). Maker needs 3/5 tricks. Euchre = -2pts.',
    Player: 'The up-card is King of Hearts. You hold Right Bower (Jâ™¥), Left Bower (Jâ™¦), Ace of Hearts, Queen of Hearts, and 9 of Spades. Order it up! You have Right Bower, Left Bower, Ace of trump + another trump = near-certain March (all 5 tricks).',
